From a5d1180fd472d70cb973efc79e78c1ecd2749747 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:32:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Link tokens to statblock notes without Fantasy Statblocks

Link Statblock listed nothing without Fantasy Statblocks, although a link
already works without it: resolveLinkedCreature reads a note's frontmatter
or statblock fence, and linking gives the token the note's name and
resources. Without the plugin the dialog now reads the vault's statblock
notes, as it already did for the notes the plugin never parsed (marked
statblock: true, or holding a statblock fence), and says how to mark a note
when there is none. Previewing a statblock still needs the plugin, for its
layouts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
